   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "makeQuiz(topology, seed, count) runs computeForSource(), picks a row (S, D, protected link S–E) and\nasks one of 8 kinds of question:",
   "originalText": "makeQuiz(topology, seed, count) runs computeForSource(), picks a row (S, D, protected link S–E) and\nasks one of 8 kinds of question:",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a20-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 790,
   "height": 175,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Kind          Question                                       Right answer from\n------------  ---------------------------------------------  ---------------------------------\nloop-free     Is neighbor N loop-free for D?                 the candidate’s Inequality 1 (B3)\nbest-lfa      Which neighbor does S pick as its LFA?         lfa.best (B7, A16), else \"No LFA\"\nmethod        Simplest method that protects S → D?           protectedBy (B20)\np-space       Is Y in S’s P-space?                           rlfa.pSpace (B8)\nq-space       Is Y in E’s Q-space?                           rlfa.qSpace (B10)\npq-node       Which PQ node does Remote LFA tunnel to?       rlfa.best, else \"No PQ node\"\nextra-labels  How many labels on top of D’s label?           extraLabels, \"3 or more\" from 3\nlabel-stack   Which stack does TI-LFA send?                  labelStack (B18)",
   "originalText": "Kind          Question                                       Right answer from\n------------  ---------------------------------------------  ---------------------------------\nloop-free     Is neighbor N loop-free for D?                 the candidate’s Inequality 1 (B3)\nbest-lfa      Which neighbor does S pick as its LFA?         lfa.best (B7, A16), else \"No LFA\"\nmethod        Simplest method that protects S → D?           protectedBy (B20)\np-space       Is Y in S’s P-space?                           rlfa.pSpace (B8)\nq-space       Is Y in E’s Q-space?                           rlfa.qSpace (B10)\npq-node       Which PQ node does Remote LFA tunnel to?       rlfa.best, else \"No PQ node\"\nextra-labels  How many labels on top of D’s label?           extraLabels, \"3 or more\" from 3\nlabel-stack   Which stack does TI-LFA send?                  labelStack (B18)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
