   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Park–Miller (as in D50):  x ← x · 48271 mod 2147483647\npicks the source, the row, the kind and the order of the choices",
   "originalText": "Park–Miller (as in D50):  x ← x · 48271 mod 2147483647\npicks the source, the row, the kind and the order of the choices",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a20-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 488,
   "width": 981,
   "height": 149,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  The kinds take turns. A kind that doesn’t fit the row (no LFA candidates, no TI-LFA path…) gives way\n   to the next.\n•  No question is asked twice in one quiz.\n•  Wrong choices are real alternatives: other neighbors, other methods, the reversed stack, a stack\n   with a label missing or doubled.\n•  Uses the network’s own settings (MSD, LFA policy, node or SRLG protection): on Example 8 it asks\n   about node-protecting PQ nodes.",
   "originalText": "•  The kinds take turns. A kind that doesn’t fit the row (no LFA candidates, no TI-LFA path…) gives way\n   to the next.\n•  No question is asked twice in one quiz.\n•  Wrong choices are real alternatives: other neighbors, other methods, the reversed stack, a stack\n   with a label missing or doubled.\n•  Uses the network’s own settings (MSD, LFA policy, node or SRLG protection): on Example 8 it asks\n   about node-protecting PQ nodes.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
