   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Quiz mode turns the network on screen into practice questions: loop-free checks, P- and Q-space, PQ nodes, labels. The right answer and its explanation come straight\nfrom the engine, and a seed always gives the same quiz.",
   "originalText": "Quiz mode turns the network on screen into practice questions: loop-free checks, P- and Q-space, PQ nodes, labels. The right answer and its explanation come straight\nfrom the engine, and a seed always gives the same quiz.",
